=== quest bandits
title: The bandit problem
known: bandits_known
active: Bandits hold the old camp on the hill east of the village and stop every cart. The merchant promised a silver ring to whoever clears them out.
outcome turned: hostile.Village
    We gave the village good reason to hate us. Nobody there will thank us for anything now.
outcome cleared: alive.Bandits == 0
    The camp on the hill is empty. The merchant will want to hear about it.
    xp: 250
